            <ArticleTitle>Non-compaction visualization using ECG-gated dual-source CT.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e46-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of a 65 year-old woman examined with the new dual-source Computed Tomography scanner for coronary disease that demonstrates for the first time the imaging characteristics of non-compaction by this modality.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
